  "status": "case-owned-row-scoped-static-owner-evidence",
  "claim": "After the bounded viewMode/focus replay and the immutable first-allowed static admission, the second allowed key is the next smallest graph-closed Target121 u22106 row. Its policy-filter declaration, blocked warning, and sole return consumer form one three-statement graph whose identifier-normalized tokens are descriptor-identical in complete Target120 u22004 and Target121 u22106. Both accepted main.tsx source states already contain that exact graph in run, so no source replay is warranted. This case owns only the second allowed key at 13800348..13800355, depends on but cannot re-admit the earlier allowed key, and leaves the other eight genuine production rows deferred. Six VERSION/BUILD_TIME/GIT_SHA rows remain separately classified build macros.",
